{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2760c86f75b8288125fb6a8fa3ac9ebd32e4daf5ff16f15d6a0db354ec8d953b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:467cac9a894f73626100c6ae3c66dbbf4c5396185f0c887ac470c3f07bcd9f02",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n贺年卡的图片，我刚才确认过啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac66b1f52b1dd082b6019fc4c54884930d5b25ca2c81958b3708e9f801105b1",
      "text": "看着做好的图片，\n我都迫不及待想看到它送到大家手上的那天了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a24d103c4f978ee55406793bb5ecbf5b784b79f0f110db206a20a83eec58507",
      "text": "果然那张照片里的日出超级漂亮，\n充满神秘感呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb13fe499bdb00e9c9f1aaa22172804b86af34878ebbfc5c861f0dd2b0a986ff",
      "text": "看来早起去抢日出的时间点，\n完全是正确的选择呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3c3739718179fa002c9b8af79e673a05a10606982a9bf91fe353d301db901f",
      "text": "制作人和工作人员的大家也大清早就\n陪着我一起去，真的很感谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69e216ce93d08cf79392de269383e42fb4e18556957b42d20dde06bf3353a8e6",
      "text": "亲自参与制作，看到点子真正地\n化为现实，真的超级开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b58d46b140e30b84ee15940380c2b0e8a7b534e715c53bbde8f2980f6ad402",
      "text": "虽然相应地也有难度，但能接下这份工作\n真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77776eb945e97ba58a7d3834d0de6faeb52d6c7b24b52ee16aa4d95200ffc522",
      "text": "是展现了闪光品味的\n一张佳作呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3050618a4690602b794bec89ee1950c2618cc95a06c5c3f08e523bb17b7ec61",
      "text": "连我也想要\n这张贺年卡了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e1baedabf663bdc2cbcc99731fe993f19750979922feb4ac3f570e8a7404e8e",
      "text": "谢谢你……！多亏了大家，\n成了完全符合理想的一张照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56a5dce361c1983e1fea6a472e331c8e4414aadaa081119a7b6741481f0ef1b6",
      "text": "能听到你这么说，我超级开心的！\n要是粉丝大家也能这么觉得就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32186ebb71890543a7950e4468dd657e4e512b33894b2647b864e2fcdef97e2b",
      "text": "我自己也想把这张贺年卡作为珍贵的回忆\n一直珍藏着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_a:2_4_030_02_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd2a9a8618122eae30afbd2d50eeba2756250d563fe117e5f9ccc7e956a39ae",
      "text": "为了在接下来的这一年里，也能创造很多美好的回忆，\n我会努力工作的！那么，再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
